            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kimchi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Start off with a chopped onion and garlic, sauté till softened; add some Italian seasoning, fresh chopped basil, some white wine, and even some mushrooms will add a bit of flair. It is better when thickened a bit. Skip the water just use clam juice and some white wine for the base of the sauce.",
